    <briefdescription>
<para>Pricing engine for compound options using analytical formulae. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The formulas are taken from &quot;Foreign Exchange Risk&quot;, Uwe Wystup, Risk 2002, where closed form <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_greeks" kindref="compound">Greeks</ref> are available. (not available in Haug 2007). Value: Page 84, <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_greeks" kindref="compound">Greeks</ref>: Pages 94-95.</para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000005"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>the correctness of the returned value is tested by reproducing results available in literature. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
